[{"title":"青城纪游赠刘珥江","author":"杨慎","text":"爱山人少说山多，名山之约恒蹉跎。\n羡君胸次有丘壑，偕余步屣寻松萝。\n晨发浣花道，夕憩郫筒阿。\n子云阁上蠹简散，杜宇城头乌尾讹。\n鸿蒙岧嵉临天谷，崖阜?嵲瞰惊波。\n离堆㑂佛蟠赑屃，都堰蜿蜒压蛟鼍。\n翩如楚矶驾黄鹤，驶如蜀栈骑青螺。\n昌蕧扶掖赤藤杖，谢公屐齿青苔窠。\n王乔双舄能济胜，郑虔檐花同经过。\n伏龙仙观模断碣，疏江新亭听俚歌。\n下濑千筏风外鹢，遥岑一点烟中螺。\n漏天夜雨丹枕警，朝云解駮红镜磨。\n玉壶携春恣谈笑，银鞍傍险仍婆娑。\n明月津亭又分袂，暌景后命江阳舸。\n聊书短韵邀君和，青城回首青嵯峨。\n浮生聚散飞鸿似，四者难并将柰何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4002,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太华寺别张季文","author":"杨慎","text":"华顶云，滇海月。\n携手三度游，同心两回别。\n携手同心此地分，他乡客路复离群。\n明年载酒花林下，啼鸟春山谁共闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4003,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"剌桐花行","author":"杨慎","text":"剌桐花，苍梧树。\n潇洒迎凉辰，庵蔼留炎暮。\n渥翠扫蛮烟，飞英飘瘴雾。\n蛮烟瘴雾雨馀天，耀彩舒芳最可怜。\n红欺鹦喙浅，砂点鹤头鲜。\n连林千炬烂，照水百枝然。\n星回节后流萤院，乞巧楼前乌鹊筵。\n边候两年通象译，方隅万里接龙编。\n故乡殊未返，空园聊息偃。\n一夕复一朝，竹看岁华晚。\n环波海碣渺渺流，干云金碧层层献。\n汀际遥瞻柳浑洲，陇坻长望张衡坂。\n钩陈阁道紫微垣，鸣銮曳佩列文轩。\n建章东回下鹄沼，甘泉西对宿麟园。\n金芝炜晔商飙起，玉植青葱瑞露繁。\n翡翠丛中游蛱蝶，莺黄叶底集雏鹓。\n枝近上林全许借，树高温室竟无言。\n讵信长年悲落木，谁怜迁客赋登薠。\n归去来，定何日，秋菊英英桂将实。\n憩蘧庐，宴蓬荜，浊酒田家醉不辞，清缨渔父愁先失。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4004,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪关谣","author":"杨慎","text":"雪山关，雪风起。\n十二月，断行旅。\n雾为箐，冰为台。\n马毛缩，鸟鸣哀。\n将军不重来，西路何时开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4005,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伏枕行赠严应阶","author":"杨慎","text":"慎也投荒今五年，朅来卧病左足偏。\n临床伏枕与子别，心断神伤魂黯然。\n忆昔去国行戍边，吊影累累入瘴烟。\n永昌试问在何处，都门相违万三千。\n虎豹昼横林箐侧，魑魅夕度关山颠。\n肝肠欲绝陇头水，梦寐忽到夜郎天。\n肉黄皮皱形半脱，喜一见子日周旋。\n除馆西河客乐土，倾壶北道宾初筵。\n悲歌慷慨悲壮士，风流儒雅追先贤。\n解鞍青华洞，褰裳碧玉泉。\n抽子琼敷藻，枉我瑶华萹。\n衰迟远寻留药价，寂寞时共买山钱。\n同手意气同兄弟，异乡会合情尤异。\n贫鐜岂叹云雨翻，急难实在风波地。\n昂昂严夫子，矫矫人中龙。\n长才抱经济，大雅含舂容。\n叩之清庙絙朱瑟，悬之东序铿金镛。\n我今甘心憔悴穷山中，子亦胡为淹留簿书丛。\n朱轮五马人马贵，青翰双鱼海若宫。\n七泽霜风鸣五两，白蘋丹枫渺予望。\n分手遥指大江西，愁心巳挂匡庐上。\n严夫子，交谊非凡流，往时倾盖今回头。\n子行高步隘九州，我病崔隤思一丘。\n水蛩草駏那忍弃，云鹏篱鴳难相求。\n待子功成采药去，期子共结逍遥游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4006,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画草虫为黄月坡赋","author":"杨慎","text":"天下几人画草虫，吴兴公子痴孙隆。\n冰缣雪练鸣趯趯，丹屏绣几飞薨薨。\n渔父蜻蜓爱钓缕，美人蟋蟀嫌雕笼。\n百种生意何融融，夷羊非羊鸿非鸿。\n长卿带晚翠，简子矜秋红。\n王孙西游归未得，清江碧草烟濛濛。\n忆昔曹不兴，点蝇惑?翁。\n滕王扫蛱蝶，摹榻喧唐宫。\n宋家道君入能品，鸾标鼊轴沉毡穹。\n古来好手竟寂寞，老痴江东洒绝迹。\n君不见醯鸡发覆天梦梦，蠓飞硙雨春飞风。\n小痴大黠应物理，孙痴非痴乃其聪。\n痴翁之死谁继出，西川曹狂称最工。\n痴狂乃有两绝蓻，爚耀滇南与江东。\n朅来曹狂数相见，吮毫蠲纸惊飞蓬。\n月坡仙人好奇者，赏鉴自与山谷通。\n凤嬉亭前月瞳瞳，更仆不知寒漏终。\n铜盘烧蜡春如烘，悬图索赋何匆匆。\n蚊脚细字盈方空，酒酣操觚持似公，雕刻自愧吾家雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4007,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观金润甫画壁歌","author":"杨慎","text":"寿亭侯庙苍山傍，金生画壁真擅场。\n只今一百五十载，火旗云马神扬扬。\n古来好手吾能说，开元之中三昩绝。\n左卫将军李思训，右丞才子王摩诘。\n金生动笔师王李，古法不坠今罕比。\n有时放遣来滇水，寻奇亦过苍山址。\n乘兴欻然扫素壁，蛟龙抃舞长风起。\n千年战功犹昨日，䬃爽英姿烱不死。\n想见解衣槃礴时，寂寞后代觅心知。\n蛛丝虫网日凋坏，赏者何人护者谁。\n翻嗟古来才士芜没亦何限，感慨为尔击节生遥悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4008,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题周昉琼枝夜醉图 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"宝枕垂云选梦，玉萧品月偷声。\n步摇翻霜夜艾，琼枝扶醉天明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4009,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题周昉琼枝夜醉图 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"魏帝台随风动，膝王栋与云飞。\n人门遥望碧落，仙界高连紫微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4010,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题周昉琼枝夜醉图 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"金缝缃裙一搦，玉钩罗袜双弯。\n琼腴粉英朝翠，锦致松脂夜丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4011,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题周昉琼枝夜醉图 其四","author":"杨慎","text":"永巷襞情捲玉，长门丝泪销金。\n合欢蘸晕绿浅，杨柳曲尘黄深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4012,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题周昉琼枝夜醉图 其五","author":"杨慎","text":"百子池头丽人，三花树下长春。\n襟解微闻香泽，帷褰想见横陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4013,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题周昉琼枝夜醉图 其六","author":"杨慎","text":"星䵠盈盈笑靥，云衣袅袅轻褣。\n醉妆淡紫沙幂，胡旋坠金次工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4014,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题周昉琼枝夜醉图 其七","author":"杨慎","text":"海土麻姑送酒，云间玉女投壶。\n应唉南朝老庾，水荭冷面江图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4015,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夕","author":"杨慎","text":"月暗萤头点草，露凉蚊喙开花。\n病怀不寐达旦，归梦何由到家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4016,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖十景邹和峰家藏戴文进画巨浸秋波 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"玄圃楼台近水，醉乡日月宜秋。\n万里凫舟鹢棹，千重贝阙龙湫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4017,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖十景邹和峰家藏戴文进画巨浸秋波 其二 寄张愈光六言","author":"杨慎","text":"屈子无梅花句，杜陵欠海棠诗。\n华屋不成三瓦，宝剑惟闻一吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4018,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖十景邹和峰家藏戴文进画巨浸秋波 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"斛律光敕勒咏，刘越石扶风歌。\n曲高从来和寡，妙处正不在多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4019,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖十景邹和峰家藏戴文进画巨浸秋波 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"赤壁矶头孤䳽，碧云天外冥鸿。\n酣酒无妨草圣，禁诗且作花翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4020,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖十景邹和峰家藏戴文进画巨浸秋波 其四","author":"杨慎","text":"诗须有为而作，文至无心乃传。\n苏武河梁四首，刘伶酒颂一篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4021,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖十景邹和峰家藏戴文进画巨浸秋波 其六 江山平远楼避暑六言","author":"杨慎","text":"地静一尘不起，楼高四望皆通。\n渴煮双泓茗月，饱听万壑松风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4022,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖十景邹和峰家藏戴文进画巨浸秋波 其七 永宁早发寄郭云屏","author":"杨慎","text":"后岭云开雪霁，前途车坚马强。\n自是人怜衰朽，敢云天佑忠良。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4023,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖十景邹和峰家藏戴文进画巨浸秋波 其八 周仪晚晴六言","author":"杨慎","text":"剡溪无心泛雪，衡山有意开云。\n天借黄绵袄子，怜吾七十从军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4024,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖十景邹和峰家藏戴文进画巨浸秋波 其九 感怀六言","author":"杨慎","text":"王皇香案仙吏，金马碧鸡老兵。\n我自甘为于役，众怪胡为此行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4025,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖十景邹和峰家藏戴文进画巨浸秋波 其十","author":"杨慎","text":"杨子登科之岁，周郎破敌之年。\n屈指于今三倍，不成一事华颠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4026,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄昏忽见山店倦客欢情倍增茆柴清于桂醑松明红似仙灯","author":"杨慎","text":"征途九十方半，记里二千有零。\n梦搅离心夜夜，愁添旅鬓星星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4027,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪关见梅六言","author":"杨慎","text":"自甘蛮方瘴疠，谁怜姑射肌肤。\n肠断何郎东阁，魂销林叟西湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4028,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"敞唐六言","author":"杨慎","text":"馗道穹隆龟背，折坂诘屈羊肠。\n恶溪四十八渡，怪松百千万行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4029,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沾益六言","author":"杨慎","text":"古迹碧鸡金马，畏途水菁云关。\n春迎滇阳胜境，雪送贵竹残山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4030,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林子瑞相迎至归化寺丘鸿夫杨元达继至六言","author":"杨慎","text":"遥山明如罨画，玄冬暖剧青阳。\n喜见滇云旧侣，重到并州故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4031,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠老门生八人","author":"杨慎","text":"昔年群贤沂水，今日九老香山。\n百岁重来会面，一樽相对开颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4032,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月六日温泉晚归","author":"杨慎","text":"月似银船劝酒，星如玉弹围棋。\n几杵林钟敲后，两行松火归时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4033,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"摩尼寒夜","author":"杨慎","text":"毛孔浑成白醉，鳞面忽变红酣。\n玄朔何愁滕六，青阳巳到孙三。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4034,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读余懋昭游青城山诗因寄并韩飞霞","author":"杨慎","text":"白沙一百八渡，青城三十六峰。\n樽酒此时相忆，烟霞何日重逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4035,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冷节","author":"杨慎","text":"花屿月笼钓碣，柳店风摇酒旗。\n四十五春寒节，一百六禁烟时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4036,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感通 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"飞瀑悬泉百丈，禅枝意树千年。\n桥板遥通绝涧，藤萝上合诸天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4037,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感通 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"宝地三千色界，苍山十九云峰。\n樽酒此时相聚，烟霞何日重逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4038,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感通 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"璈响云中孔雀，钟鸣霜里华鲸。\n龙树七人共坐，虎溪一笑相迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4039,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感通 其四","author":"杨慎","text":"流水高山唱咏，明月清风主宾。\n尘土不惊幽梦，乾坤自有间人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4040,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋晚","author":"杨慎","text":"婢喜蝇僵雾帐，儿誇蜗篆风楹。\n片云片雨送暑，残日残霞闪晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4041,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中招杨伯清","author":"杨慎","text":"禁酒停歌罢笑，听雨焚香煮茶。\n欲借陶公木屑，共散维摩天花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4042,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"卜云林兮栖真。\n结灵茅兮远滨。\n迥与太初为邻。\n离世遗物绝尘。\n鱼鸟自来亲人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4043,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"射干独立山椒。\n长松落落英摽。\n覆露玄云素朝。\n结璘郁仪相邀。\n景界一何参寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4044,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"长谣凄凄锵锵。\n鸾雏凤伯相将。\n鹍鸡群晨成行。\n西天老胡文康。\n上云乐奏侜倡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4045,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其四","author":"杨慎","text":"吟篁啸桐四清。\n间宫变徵希声。\n井公下博明琼。\n玉女投壶电生。\n炤景饮醴含情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4046,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其五","author":"杨慎","text":"折酲晓踏瑶茸。\n琅玕琦玗交拥。\n柯攒叶抱花捧。\n重露成帏垂陇。\n晞发忘言息踵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4047,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其六","author":"杨慎","text":"处雄虹兮标颠。\n玉树青葱际天。\n口诵石室苔篇。\n坐饮金膏冷泉。\n烱如龙汉初年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4048,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其七","author":"杨慎","text":"横看晚霭岚沉。\n餐食沆瀣沦阴。\n微披蕙带兰襟。\n追和游山九吟。\n聊以陶铸尘心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4049,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其八","author":"杨慎","text":"采秋菊兮露沾。\n黄菁玉豉金盐。\n克牣丹房药奁。\n变化七乌九蟾。\n后天独秀苍黔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4050,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其九","author":"杨慎","text":"织落毛兮为衣。\n溪谷香窱迂威。\n骏狼荐暖长晖。\n弄彻梅轸兰徽。\n看舞素雪朔霏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4051,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其十","author":"杨慎","text":"解澌圆折璿流。\n回渊比心清眸。\n游䱁皎镜中浮。\n遐想惠施庄周。\n千载一朝同游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4052,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其十一","author":"杨慎","text":"喜物论兮难齐。\n甘灭景兮云栖。\n鹪鹩何心驒騱。\n升高或斧之梯。\n谁言亨衢可跻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4053,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜云林篇 其十二","author":"杨慎","text":"两无闷兮潜龙。\n岁寒后凋惟松。\n云林朝市雍容。\n达人何心摽踪。\n逝将往兮君从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4054,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凝光门观江涨","author":"杨慎","text":"六月旧井旡禽，七月乘船入市。\n楼台蜃气晨浮，原隰龙鳞秋洗。\n望羊河伯自矜，鬻渡津人争喜。\n东林老衲厌喧，唤打暮钟清耳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4055,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即席赠任棠山","author":"杨慎","text":"红湿城中仙里，香霏阁下人家。\n幸遇风流地主，浑忘飘泊天涯。\n六彩狂呼琼略，百杯烂醉金沙。\n何日公寻黄石，壁津共泛灵槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4056,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七日游雨湖","author":"杨慎","text":"船尾轻阴细雨，楼头飞霭沉晖。\n美景良辰有客，赏心乐事无违。\n兴比王猷剡曲，踪似严陵钓矶。\n烟外青帘风舞，得鱼沽酒方归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4057,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"杨慎","text":"生长芝兰小名，嫁得庐江仲卿。\n罗带同心羞结，金钗两股牵情。\n行雨行云窈窕，非烟非雾轻盈。\n愁见远山凝黛，催人咫人离程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4058,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠琴姬","author":"杨慎","text":"美酒中山捲波，佳人上宫陈娥。\n商声若出金石，楚奏浑非绮罗。\n丽曲幽兰白雪，仙音月渚风柯。\n金徽可以娱耳，玉佩无劳当歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4059,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜即事","author":"杨慎","text":"墙头凛冽霜白，炉心榾柮春红。\n寒栗煨香巳熟，冻醪泛漾初融。\n病起一阳来复，吟成长夜方终。\n耿耿青灯背壁，影射梅花树东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4060,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军行","author":"杨慎","text":"?鹞十八从军，貔貅百万超群。\n千里独行无敌，一身是胆曾闻。\n六出羞称奇计，五饵尽是虚文。\n此际毛锥何用，毕竟刀环勒勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4061,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客","author":"杨慎","text":"合樽且醉花间，分襟易惨离筵。\n朝下东风紫陌，天涯落日青山。\n美人明月相望，游子浮云独还。\n愁见河桥柳色，劳歌一曲阳关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4062,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盘江渡","author":"杨慎","text":"庄蹻牂柯楚地，博望乘槎汉年。\n一壑云涛洚洞，两岸石磴勾连。\n树锋夕声灵籁，草际朝岚暮烟。\n倦策萧萧羸马，愁看站站飞鸢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4063,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"翕云三章章八句黄钟清宫","author":"黄佐","text":"油油翕云，维龙之朋。\n君子来思，球瑟和鸣。\n和鸣鼓庸，篚帛既共。\n式愉式诲，君子攸躬。\n油油翕云，维龙之遒。\n君子来思，鼓瑟鸣球。\n德辉孔周，云胡曾不我留。\n饮此芳醑，俾我昭受尔休。\n油油翕云，维龙之光。\n君子来思，球瑟锵锵。\n球瑟锵锵，匪曰大康。\n饮此芳醑，以俾我尚于中行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4064,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"驱马五章章五句黄钟清宫","author":"黄佐","text":"驱马滔滔，遵彼林皋。\n匪游以遨，将命靡竣，我心忉忉。\n驱马滔滔，戒我徒旅。\n匪游以遨，将命靡竣，岂求宁宇。\n悠悠彼鳣，载浮载潜。\n亦照于潭，将命靡竣，父于何瞻。\n离离彼翟，载鸣载飞。\n亦集于蓖，将命靡竣，母于何依。\n驾彼乘牡，夙夜孔皆。\n匪游以遨，念我二人，歌以告怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4065,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彼尔有棠五章章四句黄钟清宫","author":"黄佐","text":"彼尔有棠，敷贲于稷。\n焞焞輶车，迈如弗克。\n我车徂丘，六辔既柔。\n夙夜其勤，爰诹于郊。\n我车徂岨，六辔如组。\n夙夜其勤，爰谋于野。\n我车徂薄，六辔如濯。\n夙夜其勤，爰度于国。\n我车徂宫，六辔既雍。\n夙夜其勤，爰询于公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4066,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]